    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Lustwick Duchy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lustwick Duchy is an adult adventure game. You came here to escape. To disappear. After betraying the powerful organization you once served and stealing a mysterious artifact, you fled deep into unfamiliar lands, hoping to outrun your past. Exhausted and on the brink of collapse, you found shelter in a secluded cottage, where Aria, enigmatic, secretive (and attractive), offered you a place to rest. But peace is never permanent. As you settle into this new life, shadows begin to stir, and the secrets of the Lustwick Duchy reveal themselves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Duchy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A land of beauty, danger, and forgotten mysteries. Every step uncovers something new, a hidden ruin, an ancient legend, a strange occurrence that defies logic. Wander freely and delve into the region\u2019s untold stories. Whether you seek adventure, answers, or simply a moment of quiet, the Duchy has something waiting for you. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552720/extras/3cff72512bc7546b75232cb71d8aabe0.poster.avif?t=1742233827\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552720/extras/3cff72512bc7546b75232cb71d8aabe0.webm?t=1742233827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552720/extras/3cff72512bc7546b75232cb71d8aabe0.mp4?t=1742233827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Its Inhabitants</h2></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a cast of unique personalities\u2014some kind, some dangerous, and some who defy simple labels. Each will have a story to tell, a task to complete, a mini game to play, and of course a reward to unlock. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552720/extras/bb414031076df61a3deffdecabd3ac9c.poster.avif?t=1742233827\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552720/extras/bb414031076df61a3deffdecabd3ac9c.webm?t=1742233827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552720/extras/bb414031076df61a3deffdecabd3ac9c.mp4?t=1742233827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Satisfy your Lust</h2></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lustwick Duchy isn\u2019t just a place of secrets and danger, it's above all a place of desire.  As you grow closer to its inhabitants, opportunities for intimacy arise. Flirt, seduce, and build deep, meaningful relationships\u2026  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552720/extras/7ca74098288442a206e49e1b3fe840b0.poster.avif?t=1742233827\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552720/extras/7ca74098288442a206e49e1b3fe840b0.webm?t=1742233827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552720/extras/7ca74098288442a206e49e1b3fe840b0.mp4?t=1742233827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>(Yes, the game game be played with one hand only)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552720/extras/8218f495a2105b1c8dd33d57b3ad6f3d.poster.avif?t=1742233827\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552720/extras/8218f495a2105b1c8dd33d57b3ad6f3d.w